cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Research Companion"
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hasan
    given-names: Laraib
  - family-names: Rahman
    given-names: Azizur
repository-code: "https://github.com/LaraibOSS/Research-Companion"
abstract: >-
  A local-first research companion that turns a corpus of papers into a
  concept-level knowledge graph, answers questions with citations to the exact
  paper and section, and checks a draft against the literature — alignment
  scoring, citation verification, gap analysis, and integrity checks. The
  deterministic core runs with no API key and no network.
keywords:
  - literature-review
  - knowledge-graph
  - research-tools
  - citation-verification
  - academic-writing
  - retrieval-augmented-generation
  - local-first
license: MIT
version: 0.8.0
